      491.9,
      538.56,
      638.23
    ],
    "text": "Increase in rainfall over the southwestern parts of the island and, increase in wind speed across the island are expected from tomorrow (03) and during the next few days. Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts. Heavy falls above 100 mm are likely at some places in Western and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts.",
